{"role":"assistant","content":"Two bugs in my test harness, not the app: `urllib` follows 302s (so the authorize redirect looked like a 200), and my `/api/me` readiness probe omitted the auth header (it 401s). Fixing the harness:","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_fKCsSq25ALSgy69ZFsRJIVjs","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"new_string\":\"def req(method, url, headers=None):\\n    class NoRedirect(urllib.request.HTTPRedirectHandler):\\n        def redirect_request(self, *a, **k):\\n            return None\\n    opener = urllib.request.build_opener(NoRedirect)\\n    r = urllib.request.Request(url, method=method, headers=headers or {})\\n    try:\\n        with opener.open(r, timeout=10) as resp:\\n            return resp.status, dict(resp.headers), resp.read().decode()\\n    except urllib.error.HTTPError as e:\\n        return e.code, dict(e.headers), e.read().decode()\",\"old_string\":\"def req(method, url, headers=None):\\n    r = urllib.request.Request(url, method=method, headers=headers or {})\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(r, timeout=10) as resp:\\n            return resp.status, dict(resp.headers), resp.read().decode()\\n    except urllib.error.HTTPError as e:\\n        return e.code, dict(e.headers), e.read().decode()\",\"path\":\"verify_fix.py\"}"}}]}
